   "relation": "compiles-to"
  }
 ],
 "level_notes": {
  "1": "The standard in dhall-lang/dhall-lang/standard is a formal natural-deduction specification (syntax ABNF, type inference, normalisation, imports, binary CBOR encoding) plus executable Haskell.",
  "0": "dhall-haskell is the reference implementation; dhall-rust and dhall-golang are others; the dhall-lang/tests directory is the shared conformance suite.",
  "2": "docs.dhall-lang.org hosts tutorials (the site was unreachable from the sandbox at writing time, so its links are omitted)."
 },
